<title>SRI LANKA: Sri Lanka T-bill yields rise at weekly auction.</title>
<headline>Sri Lanka T-bill yields rise at weekly auction.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1996-10-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>The average yields of three, six and 12-month Sri Lankan treasury bills rose at Wednesday's auction with bids amounting to 8,851 million being received, the Central Bank said.</p>
<p>		  bids received   bids accepted   avg yield</p>
<p>    3 months     4,555	     3,995	  17.89 (17.85)</p>
<p>    6 months	 325		 250	  17.91 (17.85)</p>
<p>    12 months    3,971	     2,371	  17.98 (17.91)</p>
<p>NOTE - Bids in million rupees, yields in percent (previous week's yields in brackets).</p>
<p>--Colombo newsroom (941) 434319</p>
